    ],
    "text": "DUTY ON BOTTLED TODDY",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      398.65,
      539.85,
      421.72
    ],
    "text": "BY Virtue of the powers vested in me by Sub-Section (1) of Section 22 of the Excise Ordinance (Chapter 52) as amendedfrom time to time, I, Ravi Karunanayake, Minister of Finance do by this Order direct that, with effect from 01.01.2016 :-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      80.25,
      434.65,
      539.9,
      457.72
    ],
    "text": "(1) There shall be levied on bottled toddy manufactured in and issued from any licensed manufactory establishedin Sri Lanka, a duty at the rate of Rupees Thirty (Rs. 30/-) per litre on bottled toddy,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      98.85,
      470.65,
      539.88,
      493.72
    ],
    "text": "Provided that such duty shall not be levied or recovered on any quantity of the aforesaid bottled toddy with isexported out of the Island ; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      80.25,
      506.65,
      539.86,
      529.72
    ],
    "text": "(2) Excise Notification No. 896 published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 1488/1 of 12.03.2007 is herebyrescinded.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
